abilities.description:
Yin swings her whip 1350 units to pull herself to a target or the world;
If the Target is an Enemy, she deals 30.0/55.0/80.0/105.0/130.0 (+100% physical power)(+80% magical power) physical damage, Slows them by 90% for 0.6s, and generates 2 stacks of Rising Storm. 
She then leaps in a direction of her choice.
